OL,3,GNEWSAMP seeks baby death child cruelty 
OL,4,Asentence review                        
OL,6,FA Lancashire MP has called for a       
OL,7,Fmother's two-year jail sentence to be  
OL,8,Freviewed after she admitted child      
OL,9,Fcruelty offences against her           
OL,10,Fthree-month-old son before his death.  
OL,12,FOliver Ryan, the Labour MP for Burnley,
OL,13,Fhas asked the attorney general to      
OL,14,Freview the sentence handed to Joanna   
OL,15,FLea, 36, following her conviction at   
OL,16,FPreston Crown Court on Monday.         
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
