OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMP seeks baby death child cruelty 
OL,4,Asentence review                        
OL,6,FLea, from Rochdale, pleaded guilty to  
OL,7,Fchild cruelty offences committed before
OL,8,Fthe death of her son, Allister Von Lea,
OL,9,Fin August 2022. Post-mortem            
OL,10,Fexaminations found cocaine and the     
OL,11,Fanxiety drug pregabalin in Allister's  
OL,12,Fsystem.                                
OL,14,FRyan said he was "disgusted" by the    
OL,15,Fcruelty inflicted on the baby and      
OL,16,F"appalled" by the two-year prison      
OL,17,Fsentence.                              
